{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓團少女時代隊長泰妍與Yoon A、女團TWICE成員娜璉，以及aespa成員Winter，將一同擔任美妝真人騷《Just Makeup 2》的主持。節目將於下周五首播，並邀請了60位頂尖化妝師與美妝創作者進行技術對決，由專業評審團評分。幾位主持人將輪流登場，在今日釋出的官方海報中，各自搭配不同美妝工具展現獨特風格。而將於本月30日推出新碟《Unspecial》的泰妍，今日在社交網公開身穿黑色吊帶喱士裙的宣傳照谷碟。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.481897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:03:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T19:57:35.542515+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:52.921642+00:00","content_hash":"2fbfbe166b999836b73e4eb474cba3091b538291f22571f6e5b2e74e9eb15a26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.481897+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}